the saddest soul of all.

234
00:13:55,336 --> 00:13:57,254
- Oh, shut up.
- All right.

235
00:13:57,338 --> 00:14:00,257
Look, we need the hot goss
on a guy who used to live here,

236
00:14:00,341 --> 00:14:01,509
uh, Michael Langdon.

