240
00:14:12,394 --> 00:14:15,314
Oh, pipe down, Billie.

241
00:14:15,397 --> 00:14:20,861
I know more about that boy
than any woman, dead or alive.

242
00:14:22,780 --> 00:14:25,950
But I don't spill a drop of tea
