244
00:14:28,619 --> 00:14:31,455
That's something I can get behind.

245
00:14:31,539 --> 00:14:32,873
What do you want?

246
00:14:32,957 --> 00:14:37,628
To remove that insufferable
cloudy-eyed ginger

247
00:14:37,711 --> 00:14:40,589
