248
00:14:40,673 --> 00:14:42,466
You want us to fire the help?

249
00:14:42,550 --> 00:14:44,468
Well, if you really do have

250
00:14:44,552 --> 00:14:47,221
witchcraft at your disposal,

251
00:14:47,304 --> 00:14:49,348
then why don't you just

252
00:14:49,431 --> 00:14:52,685
abracadabra that goddamn bitch

253
00:14:52,768 --> 00:14:55,354
out of my afterlife, huh?

254
00:14:55,437 --> 00:14:59,775
